| ShortSummary    = While Delmon is lost in a memory of his wife and a flower-covered home, Zanka and Tamsy face teammates who perceive Amo as a loved one. Tamsy summons his vital instrument, the Tokushin, a distaff, and as the Giver, uses it to bind everyone in tight coils. He then spins the mass, crashing it through the floors. The trapped Cleaners land violently below, with Rudo impaled and Delmon unconscious, but Remlin's protective spell heals their nearly fatal wounds. At headquarters, Semiu tells Corvus that Rudo has a Curse inside him. After recovering their masks, a enraged Rudo brutally beats Amo, forgetting their mission until Enjin intervenes. As Tomme treats Amo's injuries, Amo reveals she saw the angel that travels between the Sphere and the Ground.
| LineColor       = B60000
}}
