=== Video game ===
In December 2025, a [[RPG video game]] by Com2uS Group was announced.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Hazra|first=Adriana|date=December 21, 2025|url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2025-12-21/gachiakuta-rpg-announced-for-ps5-xbox-pc-via-steam/.232311|title=''Gachiakuta'' RPG Announced for PS5, Xbox, PC via Steam|website=[[Anime News Network]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251221201934/https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2025-12-21/gachiakuta-rpg-announced-for-ps5-xbox-pc-via-steam/.232311|archive-date=December 21, 2025|url-status=live|access-date=December 21, 2025}}</ref> Titled ''Gachiakuta: Breakout'', the game is set to be released for [[PlayStation 5]], [[Xbox Series X and Series S]], and Windows (via [[Steam (service)|Steam]]) in 2027.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Cayanan|first=Joanna|title=''Gachiakuta'' Game Streams Gameplay Trailer, Reveals Official Title|url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-09-17/gachiakuta-game-streams-gameplay-trailer-reveals-official-title/.241903|website=[[Anime News Network]]|access-date=September 17, 2026|date=September 17, 2026|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260917142145/https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-09-17/gachiakuta-game-streams-gameplay-trailer-reveals-official-title/.241903|archive-date=September 17, 2026|url-status=live}}</ref>

=== Stage play ===
A stage play adaptation of the manga was announced in December 2025. It was held at the Stellar Ball in [[Tokyo]] from May 22–26 and 29–31, 2026, and at the Rohm Theater in [[Kyoto]] from June 5–7. Go Ueki directed the show, and Watashiomu wrote the script. The music was directed by Ken the 390 and written by Yoshizumi and Mush Tanaka. The cast included Hikaru Imamaki as Rudo, who was replaced by Ryota Kamiya after Imamaki injured his leg on May 26, Yuta Tachibana as Enjin, Yū Fukuzawa as Zanka, Sena as Riyo, Dai Isono as Corvus, Saho Aono as Semiu, Masamichi Satōnaka as Tamsy, Shō Arai as Delmon, Takeshi Terayama as Gris, Yui Yoko as Amo, Cocoa Nanase as Remlin, Ryosei Tanaka as Jabber.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Tai|first=Anita|title=''Gachiakuta'' Manga Gets Stage Play|url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2025-12-22/gachiakuta-manga-gets-stage-play/.232360|website=[[Anime News Network]]|access-date=December 23, 2025|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251223031629/https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2025-12-22/gachiakuta-manga-gets-stage-play/.232360|archive-date=December 23, 2025|date=December 22, 2025|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last=Cayanan|first=Joanna|title=''Gachiakuta'' Stage Play Cancels Performances After Rudo Actor Gets Injured|url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-05-28/gachiakuta-stage-play-cancels-performances-after-rudo-actor-gets-injured/.237898|website=[[Anime News Network]]|access-date=May 28, 2026|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260528121013/https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-05-28/gachiakuta-stage-play-cancels-performances-after-rudo-actor-gets-injured/.237898|archive-date=May 28, 2026|date=May 28, 2026|url-status=live}}</ref>

== Reception ==
=== Manga ===
The columnist for ''[[Real Sound (website)|Real Sound]]'' liked the world building, action, and [[dark fantasy]] elements of the story, as well as the main protagonist.<ref name="Genre">{{Cite web|url=https://realsound.jp/book/2022/03/post-987436.html|script-title=ja:漫画×グラフィティの鮮烈な作風で話題！『ガチアクタ』が切り拓く、新たな表現と戦い方|website=[[Real Sound (website)|Real Sound]]|language=ja|date=March 16, 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220816141116/https://realsound.jp/book/2022/03/post-987436.html|archive-date=August 16, 2022|url-status=live|access-date=September 1, 2022}}</ref> Masaki Endo from ''[[Culture Convenience Club|Tsutaya News]]'' liked the artwork and the main protagonist of the series.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Endo|first=Masaki|url=https://tsutaya.tsite.jp/news/book/41577165/|script-title=ja:マンガ表現の新たな可能性に挑むダークファンタジーは鮮烈にして強烈――『ガチアクタ』|website=[[Culture Convenience Club|Tsutaya News]]|date=June 30, 2022|access-date=September 1, 2022|language=ja|archive-date=September 1, 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220901005105/https://tsutaya.tsite.jp/news/book/41577165/|url-status=dead}}</ref> [[Atsushi Ohkubo]] recommended the series.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://mantan-web.jp/article/20220516dog00m200047000c.html|script-title=ja:ガチアクタ：「炎炎ノ消防隊」大久保篤が主人公描く 「一目瞭然！ これはガチ！」|website=[[Mantan Web]]|language=ja|date=May 17, 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220901005511/https://mantan-web.jp/article/20220516dog00m200047000c.html|archive-date=September 1, 2022|url-status=live|access-date=September 1, 2022}}</ref>

