eb|last=Cayanan|first=Joanna|date=April 8, 2024|url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2024-04-08/48th-annual-kodansha-manga-awards-nominees-announced/.209646|title=48th Annual Kodansha Manga Awards' Nominees Announced|website=[[Anime News Network]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240408091203/https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2024-04-08/48th-annual-kodansha-manga-awards-nominees-announced/.209646|archive-date=April 8, 2024|url-status=live|access-date=April 8, 2024}}</ref> it won the award in the 50th edition in 2026.<ref>{{cite web|last=Cayanan|first=Joanna|title=''Gachiakuta'', ''Re-Living My Life with a Boyfriend Who Doesn't Remember Me'', ''The Darwin Incident'' Win 50th Kodansha Manga Awards|url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-05-11/gachiakuta-re-living-my-life-with-a-boyfriend-who-doesnt-remember-me-the-darwin-incident-win-50th-/.237244|website=[[Anime News Network]]|access-date=May 11, 2026|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260511063733/https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-05-11/gachiakuta-re-living-my-life-with-a-boyfriend-who-doesnt-remember-me-the-darwin-incident-win-50th-/.237244|archive-date=May 11, 2026|date=May 11, 2026|url-status=live}}</ref>

